      "note": "The slot stores only the created transaction. A client that reuses an X-Idempotency key for a different body, action or API version gets 201 with X-Idempotency-Replayed and the earlier transaction, while its own posting never happens. The dedup key matches requests it should not: the caller believes the money moved."
